218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 183 0 R
/E (system designed todetect a predefined wake word or voice command locally on an edge device. Unlike conventional voice assistants that depend heavily on cloud servers, the proposed system performs the initial voice detection and processing directly on the device. This reduces response latency, minimizes network dependency, and improves privacy.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 183 0 R
/E (The system continuously monitors audio input through a microphone using a lightweight voice-processing algorithm. When the specified activation word is detected, the system triggers the required action or passes the command to the next processing stage. The system is designed to consume low computational power and memory, making it suitable for resource-constrained devices such as microcontrollers, embedded systems, smart appliances, and IoT devices.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
